The function dynamically creates UE contexts based on the specified maximum number of UEs, validates their measurements for consistency, and writes them to separate files using `write_ue_context_to_file()`. It uses pthreads to create multiple worker threads to parallelize the creation and writing process. This design allows you to initialize thousands of UE contexts per second while minimizing latency and ensuring reliability.

