The code also takes configuration parameters for adjusting the range of random values for offsets and keys as well as the number of threads and records. Additionally, it provides a clear and modular structure that facilitates future enhancements and debugging while being optimized for performance in high-throughput environments through efficient memory allocation and deallocation.']

