The function finds and prints the largest integer in the processed records. To handle potential memory fragmentation, it uses `mmap()` to allocate a contiguous region of memory. For periodic health checks and retries of external dependencies, you may need to implement additional mechanisms that are specific to your use case and external libraries.']

